sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Grid as Grid API
    participant CH as ClickHouse Projection
    participant Pg as Source Databases

    Pg-->>CH: refresh / CDC keeps projection current
    UI->>Grid: page 0, size 100, sort by orderedAt desc
    Grid->>CH: SELECT from order_grid_flat ORDER BY ordered_at DESC LIMIT 100
    CH-->>Grid: already joined, columnar, sorted result
    Grid-->>UI: first 100 rows
